*> Test of special use 3.12 (17 section 3.12; core/src/tools-use.cob): the spear jab and charge attack.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-TOOL-USE-3-12.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-I1 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I2 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I3 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I4 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I5 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I6 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I7 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I8 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-T1 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-T2 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-T3 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-O1 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O2 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O3 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O4 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O5 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-O6 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X1 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-X2 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-X3 PIC X(48).
 01 WS-OBS PIC X(240).
 01 WS-E1 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E2 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E3 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E4 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E5 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E6 PIC -(9)9.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "acceptance US14 spear: the Attack packet never runs for a spear (piercing_weapon), the jab needs the full attack strength (minimum_attack_charge 1.0)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-SPEAR-ATTACK-IGNORED" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-SPEAR-ATTACK-IGNORED" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-SPEAR-JAB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 999 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I2
     CALL "TOOL-SPEAR-JAB" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "1 0 1 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 charge attack conditions for the iron spear: damage needs 4.6 relative and within 225 ticks, scale 1.0 for players, 0.2 for mobs" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 100 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 225 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 60 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 46 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 50 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 46 TO WS-I6
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I7
     CALL "TOOL-KINETIC-PASS" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-I7 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 300 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 225 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 60 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 46 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 50 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 46 TO WS-I6
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I7
     CALL "TOOL-KINETIC-PASS" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-I7 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 100 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 225 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 60 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 46 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 40 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 46 TO WS-I6
     MOVE 1000 TO WS-I7
     CALL "TOOL-KINETIC-PASS" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-I7 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 100 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 225 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 12 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 46 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 10 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 46 TO WS-I6
     MOVE 200 TO WS-I7
     CALL "TOOL-KINETIC-PASS" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-I7 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "1 0 0 1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 charge damage is base attack damage + floor(relative speed x multiplier): iron base 3.0, relative 10.0, m 0.95 gives 12.0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 3000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 10000 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 950 TO WS-I3
     CALL "TOOL-KINETIC-DAMAGE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 3000 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 4600 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 700 TO WS-I3
     CALL "TOOL-KINETIC-DAMAGE" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "12000 6000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 speeds are blocks per second: 0.3 blocks per tick is 6 blocks per second; a target stabbed in the last 10 ticks is skipped" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 300 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-KINETIC-SPEED" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 9 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-KINETIC-CONTACT" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 10 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-KINETIC-CONTACT" USING WS-I1 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "6000 0 1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 stab: exhaustion 0.1, base knockback 0.4; Lunge level 2 adds impulse 0.916, exhaustion 8.0 and 1 item damage" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TOOL-STAB-INFO" USING WS-O1 WS-O2
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 2 TO WS-I1
     CALL "TOOL-LUNGE" USING WS-I1 WS-O1 WS-O2 WS-O3
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-O2 TO WS-E2
     MOVE WS-O3 TO WS-E3
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) "/" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "100/400 916/8000/1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     MOVE "acceptance US14 Lunge needs: not riding, not gliding, not in water, and for a survival player food at least 7" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 7 TO WS-I6
     CALL "TOOL-LUNGE-ALLOWED" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 6 TO WS-I6
     CALL "TOOL-LUNGE-ALLOWED" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I6
     CALL "TOOL-LUNGE-ALLOWED" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 1 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 20 TO WS-I6
     CALL "TOOL-LUNGE-ALLOWED" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I1
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I2
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I3
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I4
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I5
     MOVE 0 TO WS-I6
     CALL "TOOL-LUNGE-ALLOWED" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-I3 WS-I4 WS-I5 WS-I6 WS-O1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-OBS
     MOVE WS-O1 TO WS-E1
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-OBS
     PERFORM ADD-OBS
     MOVE "1 0 1 0 1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK-DONE

     STOP RUN.

 ADD-OBS.
     IF TL-OBSERVED = SPACES
         MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OBS) TO TL-OBSERVED
     ELSE
         STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OBS) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     END-IF.

 CHECK-DONE.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 END PROGRAM TEST-TOOL-USE-3-12.
